  "statement_html": "Déterminer la valeur exacte de l'aire du domaine compris entre <span style=\"color:blue\">\tla courbe représentative</span> de la fonction \\(f\\) définie par :\t\t\\(f(x)=- x^{2} + 2 x + 9\\), <span style=\"color:red\">l'axe des abscisses </span>,\tet les <span style=\"color:green\">droites verticales</span> d'équations \\(x = -2\\) et \\(x = 1\\).\t<p>\tL'allure de la courbe représentative de \\(f\\) est donnée ci-dessous ; le domaine est\tcolorié en jaune.\t<br>\tLe rectangle noir indique l'unité d'aire.\t</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\">\t <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\"><path d=\"M434 23h24v1h-24zM420 24h39v1h-39zM411 25h48v1h-48zM403 26h56v1h-56zM396 27h63v1h-63zM389 28h70v1h-70zM384 29h75v1h-75zM378 30h81v1h-81zM373 31h86v1h-86zM369 32h90v1h-90zM364 33h95v1h-95zM360 34h99v1h-99zM356 35h103v1h-103zM352 36h107v1h-107zM348 37h111v1h-111zM344 38h115v1h-115zM341 39h118v1h-118zM337 40h122v1h-122zM334 41h125v1h-125zM330 42h129v1h-129zM327 43h132v1h-132zM324 44h135v1h-135zM321 45h138v1h-138zM318 46h141v1h-141zM315 47h144v1h-144zM312 48h147v1h-147zM310 49h149v1h-149zM307 50h152v1h-152zM304 51h155v1h-155zM301 52h158v1h-158zM299 53h160v1h-160zM296 54h163v1h-163zM294 55h165v1h-165zM291 56h168v1h-168zM289 57h170v1h-170zM286 58h173v1h-173zM284 59h175v1h-175zM281 60h178v1h-178zM279 61h180v1h-180zM277 62h182v1h-182zM275 63h184v1h-184zM272 64h187v1h-187zM270 65h189v1h-189zM268 66h191v1h-191zM266 67h193v1h-193zM264 68h195v1h-195zM262 69h197v1h-197zM259 70h200v1h-200zM257 71h202v1h-202zM255 72h204v1h-204zM253 73h206v1h-206zM251 74h208v1h-208zM249 75h210v1h-210zM247 76h212v1h-212zM245 77h214v1h-214zM243 78h216v1h-216zM242 79h217v1h-217zM240 80h219v1h-219zM238 81h221v1h-221zM236 82h223v1h-223zM234 83h225v1h-225zM232 84h227v1h-227zM230 85h229v1h-229zM229 86h230v1h-230zM227 87h232v1h-232zM225 88h234v1h-234zM223 89h236v1h-236zM221 90h238v1h-238zM220 91h239v1h-239zM218 92h